sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Caller
    participant A as atomic_write
    participant T as Same-directory temp file
    participant F as Destination JSON
    C->>A: payload completo
    A->>T: serialise + flush + fsync
    alt serialisation fails
        A-->>C: error; remove temp; keep F
    else serialisation succeeds
        A->>F: os.replace(temp, destination)
        A-->>C: success
    end
